1129
00:56:22,940 --> 00:56:29,210
Moreover, the reason why PWA technology is crucial for ChatFlow

1130
00:56:29,210 --> 00:56:33,910
because Changliao needs to combat poor network conditions

1131
00:56:33,910 --> 00:56:37,350
Everyone understands what a poor network environment means

1132
00:56:37,350 --> 00:56:40,970
when your server is not working

1133
00:56:40,970 --> 00:56:44,250
It can also automatically upgrade

1134
00:56:44,250 --> 00:56:48,050
It can also automatically find other servers

1135
00:56:48,050 --> 00:56:52,450
then if you use a traditional website, it gets stuck

1136
00:56:52,450 --> 00:56:53,570
it gets stuck

1137
00:56:53,570 --> 00:56:54,149
right?

1138
00:56:54,149 --> 00:56:56,989
but Changliao, being a PWA

1139
00:56:56,989 --> 00:56:59,020
All its code has been cached

1140
00:56:59,020 --> 00:57:01,480
saved on your phone or computer

1141
00:57:01,480 --> 00:57:04,140
the next time you launch it

1142
00:57:04,140 --> 00:57:08,840
First, it can automatically detect if there's a new version to upgrade for you

1143
00:57:08,840 --> 00:57:11,940
even if the original main site becomes inaccessible

1144
00:57:11,940 --> 00:57:15,950
Secondly, it can still function through other servers

1145
00:57:15,950 --> 00:57:19,110
continue to operate as usual as if nothing had happened

1146
00:57:19,110 --> 00:57:20,270
browse news as usual

1147
00:57:20,270 --> 00:57:21,450
chat as usual

